  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Waste for Food Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the implementation of a circular economy model centred on organic waste collection, composting, and organic vegetable production under the concept &#x201c;Waste for Food.&#x201d;The initiative enables smallholder farmers to deliver organic waste at designated collection points in exchange for vegetables or vouchers. Community members receive training in composting practices and are either compensated with organic produce or connected to compost markets through SEKEM.This specific activity focuses on awareness-raising and community engagement components of the broader project. Other project components are financed through separate funding mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
